yet drifted deep enough into the atmosphere to make archaeological expeditions to the station impossible."}],"sections":[{"zh":"一座大型废弃空间站被困在这颗气态巨行星的大气层内部，向着巨行星内部缓慢下坠。其自重很可能在下一个千年里彻底毁坏这个空间站。\n\n好在该空间站飘入大气层还不太深，我们仍有可能对其开展考古行动。","en":"A large derelict space station is trapped in a slow terminal orbit inside the atmosphere of this gas giant. The gravitational stresses will likely destroy it completely within the next thousand years.\n\nIt has not yet drifted deep enough into the atmosphere to make archaeological expeditions to the station impossible."}],"image":"art/b7fd0fe9e7cc889bebb5.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.6200","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:342","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"site-site-star-petal"},{"target":"ancrel.8000","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0002,"group":"r29573","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:2","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8001","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29573","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:3","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8002","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29573","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:4","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8003","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29573","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:5","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8010","ki